{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"GoTo.LogMeInResolveDesktopConsole","latestVersion":"1.18.4.89","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"IT management suite with remote access, support, and ticketing","license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"IT management suite with remote access, support, and ticketing","license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"LogMeIn Resolve is an all-in-one IT management suite purpose-built for today's IT support challenges. It brings together world-class remote access and support with conversational ticketing to help you receive requests, triage problems, and fix issues quicker. Every IT team, helpdesk agent, and support request is different, which is why LogMeIn Resolve is built to meet the needs of each organization and problem, with support for all systems.","name":"LogMeIn Resolve Desktop Console","publisher":"GoTo","tags":[]},"zh-CN":{"description":"具备远程访问、支持和工单功能的 IT 管理套件","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"LogMeIn Resolve 是一款专为应对当今 IT 支持挑战而打造的一体化 IT 管理套件。它将世界级的远程访问与支持和会话式工单系统相结合，帮助您接收请求、初步诊断问题并更快地解决故障。每个 IT 团队、每位服务台代理和每项支持请求各不相同，因此 LogMeIn Resolve 旨在满足每个组织和各类问题的需求，并支持所有系统。","tags":[]}},"longDescription":"LogMeIn Resolve is an all-in-one IT management suite purpose-built for today's IT support challenges. It brings together world-class remote access and support with conversational ticketing to help you receive requests, triage problems, and fix issues quicker. Every IT team, helpdesk agent, and support request is different, which is why LogMeIn Resolve is built to meet the needs of each organization and problem, with support for all systems.","name":"LogMeIn Resolve Desktop Console","publisher":"GoTo","tags":[]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.18.4.89/app.json","detailSha256":"a15e4fd5d62da16225765ce89d409ec3ec94cb8176d188095f5ca927e0caf2a0","releaseDate":"2026-11-04","releaseD